english:
# ^#E2C344;Stat Bonuses^reset;
For example, if a weapon is indicated to bear a "60% bonus", this means that they get
- 1 + ^#96cbe7;0.6^reset; * ^#ea9931;0.12^reset; = ^#ea9931;x1.072 multiplier to their base damage^reset;
- 1 + ^#96cbe7;0.6^reset; * ^#f4988c;0.20^reset; = ^#f4988c;x1.120 multiplier to their base crit chance^reset;
- 1 + ^#96cbe7;0.6^reset; * ^#d93a3a;0.06^reset; = ^#d93a3a;x1.036 multiplier to their base crit damage^reset;

Items bought from the Project 45 Gun Shop can only have a maximum bonus ratio of ^#d93a3a;50%.^reset;

korean:
# ^#E2C344;스탯 보너스^reset;
예를 들어 무기에 "60% 보너스"가 표시되어 있다면 실제로 적용되는 배율은 다음과 같습니다.
- 1 + ^#96cbe7;0.6^reset; * ^#ea9931;0.12^reset; = ^#ea9931;기본 피해량 ×1.072^reset;
- 1 + ^#96cbe7;0.6^reset; * ^#f4988c;0.20^reset; = ^#f4988c;기본 치명타 확률 ×1.120^reset;
- 1 + ^#96cbe7;0.6^reset; * ^#d93a3a;0.06^reset; = ^#d93a3a;기본 치명타 피해 배율 ×1.036^reset;

Project 45 총기 상점에서 구매한 아이템의 보너스 비율은 최대 ^#d93a3a;50%^reset;입니다.

english:
^cyan;Tenant Type:^reset; ^#a64cff;Mage Guard^reset;
Mage guards prefer Mage Batons as their weapons.
^#ffd24c;Objects Needed:^reset;
^#BC9262;-6x Saturnian Furniture ^#8f8f8f;(any)^#BC9262;
-6x Magic Objects ^#8f8f8f;(Crystal Balls, Staff Cases, Mage Banners/posters, Enchanter's/Crystal Book)^#BC9262;
-4x Combat Objects ^#8f8f8f;(Weapon chests and displays)
^#ffd24c;Needed for higher level guards:
^#BC9262;-4x Furniture made from ^#ff4c4d;one^#BC9262; of these:^reset;
L2-Tungsten L3-Titanium L4-Durasteel
^reset;^#ff4c4d;OR ^#ffd24c;-1x Ferozium/Solarium Defense Gem for L5/L6

korean:
^cyan;세입자 종류:^reset; ^#a64cff;마법 경비병^reset;
마법 경비병은 마법 지휘봉을 무기로 선호한다.
^#ffd24c;필요 오브젝트:^reset;
^#BC9262;-6x 새터니안 가구 ^#8f8f8f;(아무거나)^#BC9262;
-6x 마법 오브젝트 ^#8f8f8f;(수정 구슬, 지팡이 케이스, 마법사 배너/포스터, 인챈터의/수정의 책)^#BC9262;
-4x 전투 오브젝트 ^#8f8f8f;(무기 상자와 진열대)
^#ffd24c;상위 레벨 경비병에 필요:
^#BC9262;-4x 다음 ^#ff4c4d;중 하나^#BC9262;로 만든 가구:^reset;
L2-텅스텐 L3-티타늄 L4-듀라스틸
^reset;^#ff4c4d;또는 ^#ffd24c;-1x 페로지움/솔라리움 방어 보석(L5/L6용)

