english:
A special breakfast platter made with exotic ingredients. Makes for a good show-off meal for experienced arcane explorers. ^orange;[The Punslinger]^reset;

^white;^green;+Swim boost^reset; 20 min.
^green;+20% Max Energy^reset; 20 min.
^green;+20% Max Health^reset; 20 min.^reset;

korean:
이국적인 재료로 만든 특별한 아침 식사 플래터. 노련한 아케인 탐험가들에게 자랑하기 좋은 식사다. ^orange;[더 펀슬링어]^reset;

^white;^green;+수영 강화^reset; 20분.
^green;+최대 에너지 20%^reset; 20분.
^green;+최대 체력 20%^reset; 20분.^reset;

english:
Popped wintercorn mixed with cold and crunchy ingredients. Basically minty popcorn. ^orange;[Silver]^reset;

^white;^green;+Frost Immunity^reset; 5 min.
^green;+10% Ice Resistance^reset; 5 min.^reset;

korean:
차갑고 바삭한 재료를 섞은 튀긴 윈터콘. 기본적으로 민트향 팝콘이다. ^orange;[실버]^reset;

^white;^green;+냉기 면역^reset; 5분.
^green;+냉기 저항 10%^reset; 5분.^reset;

english:
Looks disgusting, might taste disgusting, but enhances the consumer with Thorns and Regeneration. ^orange;[Ewok]^reset;

^green;+Thorns^reset; 4 min.
^green;+20% Max Energy^reset; 4 min.
^green;+Restores 10 Health per second,^reset; 15 sec.^reset;

korean:
역겹게 생겼고 맛도 역겨울지 모르지만, 섭취하면 가시와 재생 효과를 얻는다. ^orange;[이워크]^reset;

^green;+가시^reset; 4분.
^green;+최대 에너지 20%^reset; 4분.
^green;+초당 체력 10 회복,^reset; 15초.^reset;

english:
Why in the Cultivators name would you put this in your mouth? ^orange;[Shroomie]^reset;

^green;+Acidic Burn Immunity^reset; 5 min.
^green;+Acidic Melting Immunity^reset; 5 min.
^green;+20% Max Energy^reset; 10 min.
^red;+Poisoned^reset; 10 sec.^reset;

