english:
The mechanical counterpart to the mischievious Neki. One would think their artificial nature would result in a more polite, compliant personality, but these dubious companion-bots are hardly any different from their organic counterparts.

Race Traits species stats:
    ^#00A9FF;Attributes^reset;
^darkgray;Max Health: -^reset;
^white;Max Energy^reset;: ^green;+15%^reset;
^darkgray;Energy Regen: -^reset;
^white;Attack Multiplier^reset;: ^green;+15%^reset;
^darkgray;Defense: -^reset;
    ^#00A9FF;Resistances^reset;
^white;Fire Resistance^reset;: ^red;-10%^reset;
^white;Electric Resistance^reset;: ^red;-25%^reset;
^white;Poison Resistance^reset;: ^green;+50%^reset;
^darkgray;Ice Resistance: -^reset;
^darkgray;Physical Resistance: -^reset;
    ^#00A9FF;Immunities^reset;: ^green;Food Poisoning, Hungry, Poisoned, Starving, Suffocation^reset;
    ^#00A9FF;Racial Traits^reset;: ^#AA72FF;Don't Starve^reset;
^white;Movement Speed^reset;: ^green;+5%^reset;, ^white;Jump Height^reset; ^green;+5%^reset;, ^white;Fall Damage^reset; ^green;-15%^reset;

korean:
장난꾸러기 네키의 기계적인 대항마. 인공적인 성격을 지녔으니 좀 더 예의 바르고 순종적인 성격일 거라 생각하겠지만, 이 모호한 동반자 로봇은 유기체와 거의 다르지 않습니다.

^orange;식성^reset;: Robotic

^orange;Perks^reset;:
 Speed: ^green;6%^reset;, 낙하 피해: ^green;0.9x^reset;
 최대 에너지: ^green;+10%^reset;, Energy Regen: ^green;+10%^reset;
 ^cyan;타일 면역^reset;: 정글, 슬러시, 눈
 ^cyan;면역^reset;: 숨, 독, 벌침

^orange;Environment^reset;:
 ^green;Oil/Liquid Proto/Erchius^reset;: 건강 및 에너지 재생, 에너지 x^green;1.25^reset;
 ^red;뜨거운^reset; 생물군계: 에너지 x^red;0.9^reset;
 ^cyan;냉기^reset; 생물군계: Health x^red;0.8^reset;, ^green;10%^reset; Max Energy, ^green;10%^reset; 에너지 재생률

^orange;무기^reset;
 ^green;10%^reset; 주먹, 마그노브 마스터리, 에너지

^green;저항^reset;:
 독 ^green;20%^reset;, 물리 ^green;10%^reset;, 화염 ^green;10%^reset;, 방사능^green;5%^reset;,

^red;약점^reset;:
 건강 ^red;0. 85x^reset;, 전기 ^red;50%^reset;, 얼음 ^red;20%^reset; 
 굶주림 비율 ^red;20%^reset;

