english:
The pike is an extremely long spear with no versatility, designed for use in large formations. It is a poor option for most engagements but where reach is valued it is unrivalled.

^orange;Advanced Pike Techniques: 0.6s PARRY WINDOW | 100HP STABILITY | Parry hitbox does not cover the body.^reset;
^#FFEEC6;Cavalry Brace [SHIFT]: Raise the spear forward, bracing for an attack. High THRUST and BLEED DMG is dealt on enemies that contact the point.^reset;

korean:
장창은 다재다능성이 없는 극도로 긴 창으로, 대형 편성용으로 설계됐습니다. 대부분 교전에선 나쁜 선택이지만 도달 거리가 중요한 곳에선 무적입니다.

