english:
''What will we do with a drunken whaler?''

^orange;Final strike afflicts 3s RENDING (Bleeding deals +20 DMG/s | No effect if not bleeding).^reset;
^#D6DFFF;Efficient Takedown [BLINK into enemy]: Deals 200 THRUST and BLEED DMG | +5 Mana/s Regen for 5s after 2s | 0.25s windup | 20 MP.^reset;
^#FFEEC6;Onehanded Parry: Hold [SHIFT] | Whirlwind of the Isles: 0.6s PARRY WINDOW | 20 STABILITY.^white;

